        "bodyHtml": "切换主手武器与副手武器，装备<span><span><span style=\"color: #00e6b8\">通碧</span><br /><br /><span style=\"color: #e6005c\">断魄</span><br /><br /><span style=\"color: #1a75ff\">荧焰</span><br /><br /><span style=\"color: #ffffcc\">折镜</span><br /><br /><span style=\"color: #a64dff\">坠明</span></span></span>。",
